    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Communication between players is crucial for this game. While we Highly recommend an environment where players can communicate via voice chat, please be aware that the game does <strong>not</strong> include a built-in voice chat feature. Please keep this in mind before purchasing.</u><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Your friendship will be tested by\u00a0A whirlwind of &quot;cooperation&quot; and &quot;crazy happenings&quot;...</strong><br><strong>A high-difficulty, two-player parking game where communication is key!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6<strong>Have a blast with friends in chaotic &quot;high-difficulty parking&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only goal: <strong>park the car at its destination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/390be7823768ff99bd6c2f15df800b1d.poster.avif?t=1755142968\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/390be7823768ff99bd6c2f15df800b1d.webm?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/390be7823768ff99bd6c2f15df800b1d.mp4?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned. This is not an ordinary parking...!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>One wrong move, and BOOM!</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit and you're out! Communicate and give directions to survive the nail-biting tension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/cfa88cd88f5df713fd2aab08546f327f.poster.avif?t=1755142968\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/cfa88cd88f5df713fd2aab08546f327f.webm?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/cfa88cd88f5df713fd2aab08546f327f.mp4?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You age outside the car?!</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside, and you'll begin to age rapidly! (And in the end...) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/f7942cf25efcc73f46d7a0138ac0bc92.poster.avif?t=1755142968\" width=408 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/f7942cf25efcc73f46d7a0138ac0bc92.webm?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/f7942cf25efcc73f46d7a0138ac0bc92.mp4?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time outside is limited, so you'll need to skillfully swap drivers to proceed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/5b85ccaf241157e1514977ec31b42111.avif?t=1755142968\" width=400 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Add to your Wishlist now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1755142968\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*We welcome individuals to create and share gameplay content, including live streams and videos, of this game.Monetization through partner programs or creator programs on platforms like YouTube and Twitch is also permitted. However, for commercial use by corporate entities, please contact us directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game uses AI generation tools to create some of its graphical assets. All assets have been supervised and modified by the development team to fit the game's world and aesthetic.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Communication between players is crucial for this game. While we Highly recommend an environment where players can communicate via voice chat, please be aware that the game does <strong>not</strong> include a built-in voice chat feature. Please keep this in mind before purchasing.</u><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Your friendship will be tested by\u00a0A whirlwind of &quot;cooperation&quot; and &quot;crazy happenings&quot;...</strong><br><strong>A high-difficulty, two-player parking game where communication is key!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6<strong>Have a blast with friends in chaotic &quot;high-difficulty parking&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only goal: <strong>park the car at its destination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/390be7823768ff99bd6c2f15df800b1d.poster.avif?t=1755142968\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/390be7823768ff99bd6c2f15df800b1d.webm?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/390be7823768ff99bd6c2f15df800b1d.mp4?t=1755142968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned. This is not an ordinary parking...!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>One wrong move, and BOOM!</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hit and you're out! Communicate and give directions to survive the nail-biting tension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea